<title>USA: U.S. lead stocks up in March - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. lead stocks up in March - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead stocks held by U.S. refiners rose to 23,548 short tons at the end of March from 13,043 short tons at the end of February, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Production of lead rose to 35,113 short tons in the month from 31,454 short tons in February.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants fell to 24,674 short tons in March from 27,761 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
